to model","messageBody":"Contacts need a follow-up date so agents know when to contact them\nnext. Add a FollowUp value class that accepts dates in DD-MM-YYYY\nformat only and rejects dates that do not exist, such as 31-02-2026.\n\nThe class is not wired into Person yet; that will be done separately.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":91,"deletions":0},"test-code":{"insertions":112,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"e3c33ff6eee8c854c1f03c8b19500ae96669a41d","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Align delete messages with the feature spec","messageBody":"Show only the contact\u0027s name when a contact is deleted, and refer to\ncontacts instead of persons in the delete usage and invalid index\nmessages, as described in the MVP feature specification.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":5,"deletions":5},"test-code":{"insertions":2,"deletions":2}}},{"hash":"5888ef0266c5561540bfd9ca0d9fdf5eb3884b74","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Use Easy-Insurance as the product name on site","messageBody":"The navbar and page titles said EasyInsurance, while the README and\nthe guides say Easy-Insurance. Use Easy-Insurance everywhere.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":1,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"7215dcddb5fcd6accd5569ea21ba2a9f769481ae","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Replace AB3 names users see with Easy-Insurance","messageBody":"The window title, JAR file, log file and startup log lines still used\nthe AddressBook names. Rename them to Easy-Insurance so the app matches\nthe product name, and update the guides that mention the JAR name.\n\nThe data file keeps its name, so contacts already saved in\ndata/addressbook.json still load.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":5,"deletions":5},"other":{"insertions":1,"deletions":1},"docs":{"insertions":2,"deletions":2}}},{"hash":"e4383c8204ccfd3a755389fba7297088c4f7f59b","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add follow-up date to contacts","messageBody":"Agents need to record when to contact someone next. Contacts can now\nhave an optional follow-up date:\n* add accepts an optional f/DD-MM-YYYY, and warns if the date is in the\n  past (it is still saved, so agents can record past follow-ups).\n* The follow-up date is saved to and loaded from the data file. Data\n  files without it still load, as contacts with no follow-up.\n* The contact card shows the follow-up date, or None.\n* edit keeps the existing follow-up date when other details change.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":94,"deletions":10},"test-code":{"insertions":143,"deletions":2}}}]},{"date":"2026-10-08T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"d2b745286bd00d9af1536e79f05244ecaf4164fc","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge remote-tracking branch \u0027upstream/master\u0027 into align-delete-messages","messageBody":"# Conflicts:\n#\tsrc/main/java/seedu/address/logic/Messages.java\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"f2c176d2c690893f407f7ec3c85fbf10004601c3","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge remote-tracking branch \u0027upstream/master\u0027 into rebrand-app-names","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"d5b8cf784801a16be6e61ef4382dbaacf8c30ab7","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Use Easy-Insurance in clear and exit messages","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":2,"deletions":2}}},{"hash":"6663478c85c43508f42a6914459430983f64d3a7","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge remote-tracking branch \u0027upstream/master\u0027 into fix-product-name","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"7e2506f01ba885fe3d6ea51759b7c17f8003c384","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Rebrand User Guide intro and general sections","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":9,"deletions":9}}},{"hash":"7fb456e7479c1547bc2d25a7acd726cafd70a639","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Rebrand DG and us